{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0263","paragraphs":[{"id":"pc355e151fa6e-1","text":"新月娟娟，夜寒江静山衔斗。"},{"id":"p4a73ce9a87af-1","text":"起来搔首。"},{"id":"pba8e5fb9831e-1","text":"梅影横窗瘦。"},{"id":"pa727d5210085-1","text":"好个霜天，闲却传杯手。"},{"id":"p0a21087413a5-1","text":"君知否。"},{"id":"p6cebaf374afb-1","text":"乱鸦啼後。"},{"id":"pf043f43370c6-1","text":"归兴浓如酒。"}]}